WEBVTT

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.670
Let's eat!

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:50.270
Let's eat.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.260
Let's eat!

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.000
After Rea had turned into a zombie,

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.450
I started recording my observations.

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:37.630
It's very crucial that I do this at all times.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:42.090
It's <i>very crucial</i> that I do this at all times.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:46.930
Geez, you don't need to record while I'm eating, do you?

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.270
What are you talking about?

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:50.810
If I did that, it wouldn't be an observational record, would it?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.110
I guess that's true...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.480
Well then, just eat your meal like you normally would.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.110
Hey, Chihiro.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.820
Aren't you the one who isn't eating their meal?

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.370
Can you cut it out?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.120
Yes...

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.630
Rea-chan, you're a vegetarian, right?

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.630
Y-Yes.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.390
No!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.590
Why?!

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.890
Why are there snails in the miso soup?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.390
Grandpa... those are clams.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.940
Eh? Huh?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.400
Is that so?!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.610
Babu.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:44.990
Babu. Babu!

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.320
Based on evidence from Rea,

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.570
there are a number of things that I understand.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:00.760
Firstly, it's fine for zombies not to sleep.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.470
However, it was worth taking the time to do it,

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:08.720
because I have to sleep normally, and Rea would get bored.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.480
She showers, even though she doesn't sweat.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.650
Also...

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:24.160
It doesn't look like she has to use the toilet either.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.410
In order to maintain the effects of the resurrection drug,

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.910
she eats hydrangea leaves every few hours.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:45.090
Babu regurgitated a ball of hydrangea leaves, just like a hairball.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.100
Rea probably does the same thing...

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:55.770
If she does, I want to capture that moment.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:04.300
Hey, hey.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.160
Is something coming out of your mouth?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.530
What are you hoping for?

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.480
Then... Then, in exchange for letting you record this,

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:20.090
you have to do as I say, okay?

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:20.540
Huh?

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.630
Something a normal girl would do.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.180
Such as?

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.760
Hey, Furuya-kun!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.270
What about this one?

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.780
Huh?

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.940
Oh, that's pretty good.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.530
Furuya-kun, please pay attention.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.530
I'd finally chosen something and all...

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:55.120
Speaking of which, you've been rather indecisive about this.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:59.040
That's because it's rare for Furuya-kun to buy me something.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.290
I have to choose something good.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:06.130
But I've already been waiting for about an hour.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:07.300
Ah!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.130
Can I also buy this hat?

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.390
Sure, but the total cost must be less than 10,000 yen.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.730
My pocket money is...

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.150
It's good that it's still overcast,

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.280
but going out in the middle of the day...

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.700
...will increase the speed at which her body gets damaged.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.870
She wanted to go shopping that much...

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.420
There's no point in coming to a place like this.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.170
This isn't how a farewell video should go.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.260
Eh? But I think that colour suits you very well!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.360
See?

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.320
It <i>is</i> good!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.190
But... I see.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:12.820
Rea definitely couldn't even do something like this in the past.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.960
Today I'll take it easier than usual.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.220
Ah...

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.970
It's soaking in.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:41.520
The bath-house in the daytime is really good.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.250
Even though he said that...

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:10.260
"I need to take responsibility for her."

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:18.060
This hot water... sure is nice.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:30.150
That's the first time I've seen Chihiro look that serious.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:36.660
There's probably an explanation for why Sanka-san became a zombie, but...

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:43.160
Suddenly living together without saying anything to me...

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.170
Looks like I've gained a little weight.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.300
Geez!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.880
Honestly...

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.680
It's always Rea-san this, Rea-san that!

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.050
What about me?

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:01.560
Oh, hello.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.600
Ah! Mero-chan!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:05.810
What a coincidence.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.350
Hey!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.810
Hi!

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.280
Excuse us.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.490
Has Wanko been in the bath-house all day?

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:21.580
Y-Yeah... because I already finished helping this morning and wanted a change of pace.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.870
So, are you having a bath with friends, Mero-chan?

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.710
Or are you returning home from somewhere?

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.630
No.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.870
Instead of going out for tea,

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.590
I thought maybe we should come to the bath-house.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.640
By the way, is Chihiro home?

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:43.930
Nii has been at a shopping centre in a nearby town since this morning,

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.690
buying clothes for Rea-dono.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.400
Hm... So they're having fun together...

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:56.740
All right!

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:00.240
Then I'll get in the bath with Mero-chan and her friends!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.740
It's a bath of jealousy!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:07.000
The three of you will hang out with me until the evening!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.010
You're going to become lightheaded...

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.260
Sorry to keep you waiting, Furuya-kun!

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.390
That looks really good on you.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.810
What did you just say?

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.860
I didn't say anything.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.240
Eh, yes you did...

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.530
No, I didn't.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.860
You said something.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.120
Please say it again.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:44.790
Huh?

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.080
Furuya-kun, did you buy something?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.290
Huh, oh.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.530
What is it?

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.090
Can you show me?

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.260
Don't worry about it.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.550
Ah, where should we go next?

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.550
We're still walking around?

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:03.280
Yes!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.850
There are still lots of places to see!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.310
Reporting in.

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:11.770
The target is currently in a local shopping centre.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:14.150
It looks like it's just Rea and Furuya.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.280
Do you want me to make a move?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.490
Understood.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:22.320
Continue observing as you have up till now.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:23.720
Ah! Over there!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:24.870
Can we go in there?

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.040
Eh? Eh?!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.830
There's no need to rush.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.830
Wait for the right time.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:35.130
Then, when Rea is by herself,

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.840
carry out the plan.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.510
Understood.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.520
This is pretty well made.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.100
However, its coarseness is a bit noticeable.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:12:00.190
Particularly, I think it would be better if this sewing were done more carefully.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.740
Say, Furuya-kun, do you think the sa-

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:03.860
Huh?

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:12.040
Furuya-kun being afraid of a haunted house...

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.080
I would never have guessed it!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.200
Shut up!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.130
What's wrong with that?

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:21.630
I like zombies and horror movies, but things like that are different.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.090
Eh?

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.720
Is that so?

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:28.890
You seem to be pretty good with...

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.280
What's with that?

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.870
Are you making fun of me?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:39.650
Despite that, you still went inside with me.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.230
Bu-

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.740
Thank you, Furuya-kun.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.460
Well, next time I won't go in.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.420
Okay.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.130
Oh, also...

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.420
For you.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.340
Since it's going to get hotter and hotter,

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:06.610
if we fill this with dry ice,

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:08.550
you can wear it to prevent your body from rotting.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:11.720
This way, even if you go outside, you should be okay.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:17.730
Also when... you go to school... or something.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:23.490
You might be able to do things like a normal girl.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.780
Furuya-kun...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:25.490
Eh?

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:31.330
Hey!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.990
What's wrong?

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.000
Is this bad?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.580
No.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:46.170
I'm really happy that you were thinking about me, Furuya-kun.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.760
But...

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:57.230
This is the first time that I have noticed... zombies can't cry.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.150
Is that so?

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.020
Yes.

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.360
What?

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:09.610
You thought you knew everything about zombies.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.270
So, I thought,

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:15.040
"There are things that even Furuya-kun doesn't know."

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.960
Well, of course there are.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:22.340
I'll teach you lots of things about zombies.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.670
Rea...

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.180
Do you intend to free yourself?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.930
That is...

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.640
...a false freedom!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:41.650
It is true that you may have felt the harshness of my discipline,

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:46.780
but if you think you can escape to freedom...

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.400
No!

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.910
Now... return, Rea!

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:57.660
I'll show you what real freedom is!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.050
Ah... This isn't good.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.010
I should eat something soon.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.770
I'll go and get something to eat as well.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.560
I'll be back soon, so eat first.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.940
Ah, sure.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.080
The only time it is a little lonely is when I eat...

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.330
...since I cannot eat the same things as Furuya-kun.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:48.300
But I guess that can't be helped.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.590
I am a zombie after all.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.680
My intestines are broken.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.560
Sanka...

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.810
Rea-san...

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.570
Hello~

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:16.580
It's such a coincidence to meet you in a place like this!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.540
Is it fate?

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.080
What's with this guy?

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:27.090
But no matter what happens, be on alert.
I have no idea!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.590
Understood.
I see.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.260
Um... Who are you?

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.050
What are you saying?

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.180
We've spent some wonderful times together.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:39.060
I'm Furuya's friend, Yasutaka.

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.100
Ah, you were the one in the school yard.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.350
Are you going shopping after this?

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.650
No, I already finished shopping...

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.170
I see.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:46.480
Should we report back to Danichirou-sama?
What should we do?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.440
You have quite the laid-back lifestyle

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:48.860
What should we do?
Should we report back to Danichirou-sama?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:49.340
I know a really good place where we can relax!

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.610
No, let's watch him for a bit longer.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.940
I know a really good place where we can relax!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:54.990
Um...

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:58.160
Eh? Rea-san, do you have poor circulation?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.620
Your hand is as cold as ice.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.580
I... um...

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.500
But that's fine.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.790
I'll take you somewhere super hot.

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:09.790
He's on the move!

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:12.800
Maybe he spotted us?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.540
No way... Who on earth is that guy?

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:15.510
How do I know?

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:17.830
We better go and catch up with them quickly!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.390
Um... Where are we going?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.210
Eh?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.940
Are we going outside?

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.860
That's right!

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.190
The two of us heading out into the beautiful sunlight...

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:35.320
...to have a laid-back and fancy lifestyle in such a crowded place...

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.780
Isn't it great?

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.450
But I...

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.450
And this bench happens to be empty...

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.450
U-Um...

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:48.830
I don't really like going outside in the middle of the day...

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.000
Oh, don't be like that!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.420
You shouldn't stay in a place with air conditioning all the time!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.160
See?

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.090
This scenery is great!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.550
Even though the fair skinned Rea-san is beautiful,

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.640
being unhealthy isn't good.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.810
That guy is still here.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.560
We might have a chance right now.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.600
He's near the exit.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:08.400
See? The summer sunlight feels great.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.190
What should we do?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.360
Should we go?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:10.860
See? The summer sunlight feels great.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.110
Come out! Hurry!

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.840
Let's go!

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:14.860
Move out!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:16.860
Leave that guy to us!

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:18.860
Let's do this at the same time!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.370
Three...

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:21.370
Two...

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.120
One...

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.490
Go!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.250
Eh?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.840
Rea?

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:45.350
Eh?!

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.330
What's with this strength?

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.500
Has she really released her brain's limiter?

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.870
Furuya-kun!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.670
No!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:12.580
I can't restrain her!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.590
Honestly... Where did she go?

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.840
Help!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:21.970
Rea!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:24.970
Rea!

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.970
What's going on?

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.690
No!

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:30.980
Don't come near me!

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.730
Um...

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.190
Rea?!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.700
Thanks for rescuing me...

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:48.240
No, I didn't do anything...

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.330
Anyway... The bench...

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.830
So her muscles are like this...

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.380
You're going to dislocate your arm!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.460
I was so scared!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:00.720
Those people tried to kidnap me...

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.510
Are you okay?

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:09.140
By the way, who's this guy?

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:09.970
I have no idea.

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:12.640
Wait, why is Yasutaka...?

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:15.650
T-To be able to stop us like that,

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.730
we need a change of plan.

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.490
Hey, what are you guys doing?

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:23.990
Why are you targeting Rea?

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.240
I'll call the police!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.450
Say something!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.240
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:31.370
Don't tell me, you're from the Sanka fam-

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.330
Behind you!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.260
Wait!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.350
Sanka... san...

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.720
Geez!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:09.080
Furuya-kun!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.540
My sincerest apologies.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:20.380
Originally we followed the plan and captured Rea-sama,

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:24.010
but she had unbelievable strength,

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.590
and we couldn't restrain her.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:28.300
Therefore, we had to change to plan B.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.930
Danichirou-sama, what should we do next?

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:35.690
Get rid of this boy, and look for Rea-sama again?

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:36.990
No.

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:38.810
Bring the boy back.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:40.190
Certainly!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.410
Excellent.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:51.330
We'll have a heart to heart conversation.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.710
Ah... Furuya.

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:42.850
Mero-chan?

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.860
Hey, Mero-chan!

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:47.530
It can't be helped.

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:48.480
I'm gonna do it.

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:50.110
Next time: Sankarea...

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:52.780
Episode 9: Mother's... Hand...

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:54.320
Everyone, you better watch! Mero~

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.330
Eh? Do it again?

00:23:56.950 --> 00:23:58.080
I see.

00:23:58.080 --> 00:23:59.700
It can't be helped...

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:03.000
It was Ranko-dono who made her entrance by mistake.

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:05.980
With this much "no good" coming from the manuscript,

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:08.000
you'll need to forgive me...

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.710
Mero-chan...
